Z||000002||Last Dodo||11-25-2001||08:19 PM||||I spoke with one of the conversion companies (I believe it was American Custom Engineering) about a year ago about installing a quad 4 into my 87 GT and I seem to remember them telling me that the tranny had to be replaced along with the engine to make it work right.  Now, mind you you that this has been 1 war and many beers ago so my memory may be failing me.<P>  I however agree with maryjane and think finding out from a reputable company and previous installer would definitely be a step in the right direction.  Good luck and I hope all turns out well.||||reg||1
